# Normalise line endings in the working tree on checkout, whatever the
# local `core.autocrlf` is set to. Without this, a Windows clone with the
# Git for Windows default (`autocrlf=true`) rewrites every text file to
# CRLF, and `git+https://` installs differ from `github:` tarball ones.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must stay byte-for-byte.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
